WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open-loop chirp torque: its direction reverses. There is no target angle.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The same recorded torque drives both systems. White is the True system; orange is the Initial model.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The waveform is the input; the velocity meters share a scale. Incorrect damping changes the response.
